    "interpretation": "Actual 3D cell centers and physical radii, including overlaps, with periodic copies clipped to the original domain. Minimum-image stable-ID bonds. Chosen concentration isosurface tinted by retained A/(A+B), not an anatomical membrane. Mixed optics assigns more opaque jade to A-rich material and clearer rose to B-rich material; this optical contrast is artistic. Front-right optical cutaway reveals the interior. Colors, faint glass skin, fibre radius, thin film and lighting are artistic; no forces, anatomy or temporal interpolation are added. This finite original trajectory excludes the separately retained later continuation."
